{title: 115 - O Come, O Come, Immanuel}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #115 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Em}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 115}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Em]O come, [Bm]O[G]come, Im[Am]man[G][D7]u[G]el, [D]And [G]ransom [C]cap[G]tive [Am]Is [D7][Em]   [Bm]ra[Em]el
[Am]That mourns in [Em]lone[B7]ly [Em]ex [G] [D][A7]ile [D]here [Em]Un[D]til [Bm]the [G]Son of [Am]God[G][D7]ap[G]pear
[G]Re[D]joice! [Em]Re[G]joice! [G]Im[Am]man[G][D7]u[Em]el [D7]Shall [G]come to [C]thee, O [Am]Is [D7][Em]   [Bm]ra[Em]el!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Em][Bm][G][Am][G][D7][G][D]Rejoice! [G][C][G][Am][D7][Em][Bm][Em]Rejoice!
[Am][Em][B7][Em]Emmanuel [G][D][A7]shall [D][Em][D]come [Bm][G][Am]to [G][D7][G]thee,
[G][D][Em][G][G][Am][G][D7][Em]O [D7][G][C][Am][D7][Em][Bm][Em]Israel.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Em][Bm][G]O [Am][G]come, [D7][G]Thou [D][G][C]Wisdom [G][Am]from [D7][Em]on [Bm][Em]high,
[Am][Em][B7]And [Em][G]order [D][A7]all [D][Em][D]things [Bm][G]far [Am][G]and [D7][G]night;
[G][D][Em]To [G][G]us [Am][G][D7]the [Em][D7]path [G][C][Am]of [D7][Em]knowledge [Bm][Em]show,
[Em][Bm]And [G][Am]cause [G][D7]us [G][D]in [G][C]her [G][Am]ways [D7][Em]to [Bm][Em]go.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Em][Bm][G]O [Am][G][D7]come, [G][D]Desire [G][C][G]of [Am][D7][Em]nations, [Bm][Em]bind
[Am][Em][B7]In [Em][G]one [D][A7]the [D][Em][D]hearts [Bm][G]of [Am][G]all [D7][G]mankind;
[G][D][Em]Bid [G][G][Am]Thou [G][D7][Em]our [D7][G][C]sad [Am][D7][Em]divisions [Bm][Em]cease,
[Em][Bm][G]And [Am][G]be [D7][G]Thyself [D][G][C]our [G][Am]King [D7][Em]of [Bm][Em]Peace.
{end_of_verse}
